<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρ-ίζω</span></b>  (A), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοῦρος</span> A) intr., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to
				be a youth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάκος . . , ὃ κουρίζων φορέεσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.185
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.195
			</span></i>; <i>to be a girl</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.666
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς ἔτι -ίζουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Dian.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cry like a babe</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Jov.</u>
				54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of dolphins,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἑὸν σθένος</span>
			<i>attain</i> the strength of <i>youth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.664
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>bring up from boyhood</i> or <i>to manhood</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνδρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					347
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουρίζεσθαι: ὑμεναιοῦσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
